    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Space Exploitation</strong> is a space mining game featuring 2D physics and a destructible environment. Set in the distant future where mining ship pilots work for exploitative corporations, you will have to improve your equipment, upgrade your ship, and master the asteroids if you want to survive and secure your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/158070aa5a2892eb88bc891875c72008.poster.avif?t=1754489545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/158070aa5a2892eb88bc891875c72008.webm?t=1754489545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Physics + Pixel Art: </strong>Chunky pixel art and physics provide satisfying crashes, shots, and explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Equipment: </strong>Everything has a price, make sure you choose the best tools for the job and conserve your scarce resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brave The Asteroid Fields:</strong> The resources of the asteroid fields aren't easy to take, there are more dangerous hazards out there than your own explosives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Bureaucracy:</strong> Stick to corporate law or take your future into your own hands, do whatever you need to do to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/dbdb7b2ab64545d3fe319fd3bd148ef3.poster.avif?t=1754489545\" width=620 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/dbdb7b2ab64545d3fe319fd3bd148ef3.webm?t=1754489545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/dbdb7b2ab64545d3fe319fd3bd148ef3.mp4?t=1754489545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Space Exploitation</strong> is a space mining game featuring 2D physics and a destructible environment. Set in the distant future where mining ship pilots work for exploitative corporations, you will have to improve your equipment, upgrade your ship, and master the asteroids if you want to survive and secure your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/158070aa5a2892eb88bc891875c72008.poster.avif?t=1754489545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/158070aa5a2892eb88bc891875c72008.webm?t=1754489545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Physics + Pixel Art: </strong>Chunky pixel art and physics provide satisfying crashes, shots, and explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Equipment: </strong>Everything has a price, make sure you choose the best tools for the job and conserve your scarce resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brave The Asteroid Fields:</strong> The resources of the asteroid fields aren't easy to take, there are more dangerous hazards out there than your own explosives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Bureaucracy:</strong> Stick to corporate law or take your future into your own hands, do whatever you need to do to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/dbdb7b2ab64545d3fe319fd3bd148ef3.poster.avif?t=1754489545\" width=620 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/dbdb7b2ab64545d3fe319fd3bd148ef3.webm?t=1754489545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656660/extras/dbdb7b2ab64545d3fe319fd3bd148ef3.mp4?t=1754489545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
